      "extract": "arXiv:0705.1468v1 [hep-th] 10 May 2007 Knots in the Skyrme-Faddeev model Paul Sutcliﬀe Department of Mathematical Sciences, Durham University, Durham DH1 3LE, U.K. Email: p.m.sutcliﬀe@durham.ac.uk May 2007 Abstract The Skyrme-Faddeev model is a modiﬁed sigma model in three-dimensional space, which has string-like topological solitons classiﬁed by the integer-valued Hopf charge. Numerical simulations are performed to",
